a":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]倒不如说是有些后怕。如果当初的自己没有下定逃跑的决心，一定不会像现在过的这样开心。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]唉？我说话很像大人吗……？也许是以前的日子对我来说太过压抑了，所以在提到的时候会像大人们的语气吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]不过现在的我已经不会像那时一样啦。跟软软相处的日子，在外面看到的一切，都是真正属于我自己的经历！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]所以，尽管这里的确很舒适……但我也不敢保证会一直待在这里。我和软软都还想去看更多没见过的景色。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"奇瓦","text":"[show]但在那之前……我还想继续在这座营地，和{myName}你们待在一起！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":0.9,"addImg":"chara019_1_face_chara019_1b","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":100,"transTime":300,"y":-423.20000000000005,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":0.9,"img":"chara019_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"软软","text":"[show]叽叽叽——！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"奇瓦-在这里住的还舒服吗？"}